# Credit categories
credits.category.project_leadership=Project Leadership
credits.category.project_leadership.detail=The people responsible for GT New Horizons' overall direction, administration, coordination, and major project decisions.

credits.category.original_mod_authors=Original Mod Authors
credits.category.original_mod_authors.detail=The original creators whose work forms the foundation of mods now maintained or continued by GT New Horizons.

credits.category.mod_development=Mod Development
credits.category.mod_development.detail=The developers and maintainers who build and improve the mods maintained by GT New Horizons.

credits.category.pack_development=Pack Development
credits.category.pack_development.detail=The people who develop GTNH's recipes, configuration, scripts, progression, balance, and pack-level integrations.

credits.category.quests=Quests
credits.category.quests.detail=The people who design, write, edit, and maintain GTNH's quest book.

credits.category.gt_multiblocks=GT Multiblocks
credits.category.gt_multiblocks.detail=The original creators of GTNH's GregTech multiblock machines. Each credited role names a multiblock the person created.

credits.category.testing_qa=Testing & Quality Assurance
credits.category.testing_qa.detail=The testers and investigators who reproduce issues, triage bugs, verify fixes, and improve compatibility and performance.

credits.category.build_infrastructure=Build & Infrastructure
credits.category.build_infrastructure.detail=The people who operate GTNH's official servers, builds, continuous integration, distribution, automation, and technical services.

credits.category.wiki_documentation=Wiki & Documentation
credits.category.wiki_documentation.detail=The editors and authors who create and maintain GTNH's wiki, guides, and technical documentation.

credits.category.localization=Localization
credits.category.localization.detail=The people who translate, review, and adapt GTNH's text for players around the world.

credits.category.art_media=Art & Media
credits.category.art_media.detail=The artists and media creators responsible for GTNH's textures, interface assets, branding, audio, and official media.

credits.category.community=Community
credits.category.community.detail=The moderators, support volunteers, and event organizers who maintain GTNH's official community spaces.

credits.category.donators=Donators
credits.category.donators.detail=The people who financially support GT New Horizons through the official GTNH Shop. Each role identifies their documented donation tier.

